#: templates/desktop/home.html:4
msgid "desktop-home-content"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ASTROMAXIMUM </b>is the most detailed astrological calendar, and at "
"the same time,<br /> <b>ASTROMAXIMUM</b> is the first astrological calendar "
"for mobile phones.</p><p>Are you going to contact your supervisor to request "
"a salary increase but do not want to come to the humiliating rejection? Do "
"you want to start your own successful business? Are you doing alright and "
"plan to buy a car, but do not want to become a regular client of a car "
"service? Are you going to do a medical examination or surgery? Are you about "
"to open a bank account?<br /><b>ASTROMAXIMUM</b> - this is the most "
"convenient tool to find the best time to implement your plans and "
"aspirations.</p><p>Choose an evil of the lesser kind, do not miss the best "
"benefit, estimate equivalent options, recognize scraps, find the best moment "
"for global projects as well as for small cases - only your intuition could "
"be an assistant, and if it goes wrong, <b>ASTROMAXIMUM</b> will help you.</"
"p><p><b>ASTROMAXIMUM</b> displays the following events*:</p><ul><li> "
"unfavorable position of the Moon ('void-of-course', VOC) and the passage of "
"the Moon over &lt;burned road&gt; ('via combusta', VC)</li><li> Solar day "
"number, according to seasonal Persian calendar Fasli</li><li> sign of the "
"Zodiac and the degree of the Sun</li><li> astronomical sunrise and sunset at "
"given location</li><li> Moon phase</li><li> Lunar day number</li><li> sign "
"of the Zodiac of the Moon</li><li> astronomical moonrise and moonset at "
"given location</li><li> number of lunar Tithi days - days of the lunar month "
"of Vedic astrology</li><li> aspects of the Moon and Moon passage between "
"aspects</li><li> important degrees of planets; aspects of planets, including "
"Uranus, Neptune and Pluto</li><li> planetary hours</li><li> degrees of "
"Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, North Node, Black and White Moon</"
"li><li> Septenary planets on horoscope axes</li><li> retrograde motion time "
"ranges</li><li> Zodiac signs ingression</li><li> ASTROMAXIMUM provides a "
"rapid horoscope for any event in the past since 1971</li><li> decumbiture - "
"ASTROMAXIMUM predicts the course of the disease</li><li> time of solar and "
"lunar eclipses.</li></ul> <p>* time range is given; each event is "
"accompanied by detailed astrological comment</p><p><b>AFFILIATE PARTNERSHIP:"
